; Satisfies electron-forge's dev-start config check (it asserts pnpm's node-linker is
; hoisted when CWD is here). Packaging does NOT need it: forge.config.js skips the
; pnpm-incompatible walks (rebuildConfig onlyModules [], prune false, node_modules ignored).
; TRAP: never run `pnpm install` with CWD inside manager/ — pnpm would apply this setting
; to the WHOLE workspace and rewrite the root node_modules to hoisted layout, silently
; breaking the runtime's Vite/Tailwind resolution. Always install from the repo root.
; (Recovery: from the root, remove all node_modules dirs and `pnpm install`.)
node-linker=hoisted
; (The bundle script strips npm_config_* from its child env so `pnpm make` can't leak
; this setting into its deploys — see scripts/prepare-bundle.mjs.)
